# Count your unread feedback. Start the API with Aspire first, then send the first requests once.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Create an account → 201. The requests below use its access token.
# @name createAccount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Zagreb"
}

### The count → 200. Until Minimalist replies, it is 0.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/feedback/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}
